---
import './SellerPayout.css';
---

<section class="seller-payout">
  <div class="seller-payout-content">
    <p class="eyebrow">A payout that makes sense</p>
    <h2>Only pay a service fee on the cake itself.</h2>
    <p>Delivery and applicable taxes are kept separate, so your marketplace service fee is based on the price of what you baked.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="seller-payout-example">
    <div class="payout-row">
      <span>Celebration cake</span>
      <strong>KES 4,000</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="payout-row payout-muted">
      <span>Delivery</span>
      <strong>Separate</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="payout-row payout-muted">
      <span>Applicable taxes</span>
      <strong>Separate</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="payout-row payout-total">
      <span>Service-fee base</span>
      <strong>KES 4,000</strong>
    </div>
    <p>Example only. Your actual rate and payout depend on your seller agreement and completed order details.</p>
  </div>
</section>
